  "id": "leader",
  "term": "leader",
  "definition": "A leader is a person whose own self-regulation and health-supportive behavior can shape employees’ self-care, psychological need satisfaction, and motivation at work. In this context, leadership is understood through how the leader supports both their own well-being and that of staff.",
